# 1. Purpose

This document defines the complete database architecture of **KnowledgeOS**.

It serves as the implementation blueprint for all persistent data used throughout the application, including user information, uploaded documents, folders, conversations, AI-generated insights, vector embeddings, and application metadata.

The database design prioritizes:

* Scalability
* Security
* Data integrity
* Explainability
* Maintainability
* Efficient AI retrieval

This document should be used together with **03_Architecture.md** when implementing backend services and APIs.

