        ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐
        │                    │                    │
        ▼                    ▼                    ▼

 PostgreSQL            ChromaDB          Supabase Storage

 Structured Data      Vector Data         Original Files

        │                    │                    │

    Users                Embeddings             PDFs

    Documents           Vector Indexes          DOCX

    Chats               Retrieval IDs           PPTX

    Messages            Similarity Search       Markdown

